> te cuxna 
>

mi stidi zo'oru'esai di'e


soi/rei/xoi = sei bilga

ei = sei te javni = should/ought to

 

>
> > http://www.lojban.org/tiki/BPFK+Section%3A+Irrealis+Attitudinals has 
